"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/TouchOrigamiExampleView":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Artboard 1 → Group (vertical stack of cards)."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/touchorigamiexampleview","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TouchOrigamiExampleView"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TouchOrigamiExampleView","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/TouchOrigamiExampleView","title":"TouchOrigamiExampleView"}}}